# Caddy snippet for the existing reverse proxy at /opt/reverse-proxy.
#
# This is a documentation snippet, not a full Caddyfile. The live Caddy
# configuration is not touched in Phase 1. Add a block like the one below to
# the existing Caddyfile when the relaunch goes live.
#
# Only the frontend is exposed to the outside. The browser sees a single
# origin (wediga.dev) served by the Next.js frontend. The frontend's own BFF
# route handlers reach the backend server-side over the internal default
# compose network via the service name "backend", while the external "proxy"
# network only connects the live Caddy to the frontend. The backend has no
# public entry and stays unreachable from outside.
#
# wediga.dev {
#     reverse_proxy frontend:3000
# }
